[{"original":"Daemon","string":"Démone","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0500085D|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"MGEF FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonFFMysticSelf"},{"original":"Summons the sword Daemon for <dur> seconds. Sheathe it to dispel.","string":"Crée l'épée Démone pendant <dur> secondes. Rengainer pour rompre le sort.","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0500085D|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"MGEF DNAM","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonFFMysticSelf"},{"original":"Daemon","string":"Démone","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000904|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"MGEF FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonFFSelf"},{"original":"Summons the sword Daemon for <dur> seconds. Sheathe it to dispel.","string":"Crée l'épée Démone pendant <dur> secondes. Rengainer pour rompre le sort.","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000904|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"MGEF DNAM","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonFFSelf"},{"original":"Daemon Enchantment","string":"Enchantement de Démone","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000908|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"ENCH FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonEnch"},{"original":"Summon Daemon","string":"Invocation de Démone","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000903|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"SPEL FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonSpell"},{"original":"Traveller's Shield","string":"Bouclier de voyageur","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"050009AE|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroTravellerShieldHeavy"},{"original":"Traveller's Shield","string":"Bouclier de voyageur","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"050009B0|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroTravellerShieldLight"},{"original":"Bandit Chief's Note","string":"Note de Brurid","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000889|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroEpochNote"},{"original":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><font size='18'>I'm locking these weapons in here where you smart guys can't get to them. These are shiny, new weapons - worth a lot of coin - none of you are going to get your grubby hands on them! </font>","string":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><font size='18'>Je viens de faire restaurer les reliques de Treva dont ce stupide Stalleo ignorait l'existence. Je compte les revendre à bon prix le moment venu.\nAhahah, mon investissement devrait être fructueux, et tant pis pour sa famille. Ici elles seront en sécurité. Bas les pattes en mon absence ! </font></font>","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000889|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroEpochNote"},{"original":"Spell Tome: Daemon","string":"Livre de sort - Démone","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000902|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonSpellTome"},{"original":"<font face'$HandwrittenFont'><font size='40'><p align='center'>\r\nDaemon","string":"<font face'$HandwrittenFont'><font size='40'><p align='center'>\r\nDémon</font></font>","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000902|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroDaemonSpellTome"},{"original":"Ingmar's Journal","string":"Journal d'Ingmar","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000D85|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroIngmarJournal"},{"original":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\" size=\"18\"><b>Journal of Ingmar</b>\r\n\r\nThe day has finally come to leave the Skaal. The Elders discovered the truth behind Skogsdrake Barrow; how I enlisted the aid of a traveller to distract the Valbrandr Draugr whilst I slew it. I couldn't face it alone, yet that was required for me to become a true Skaal. Now I am disgraced, and I leave my only home to venture in Skyrim.\r\n\r\nI have boarded a vessel named The Winter War, and will arrive in Windhelm within a few days.\r\n[pagebreak]\r\nA lot of fog and mist today. Can hardly see the glaciers any more. Why have they not constructed a lighthouse out here? Perhaps that's something I will suggest to the High King when I arrive. I just hope the captain knows where he's going... \r\n[pagebreak]\r\n\r\nHit the ice. Broke ship in half. Madness from the survivors. Broke Solvistapp when clashing with a crew member. Leaving tonight... ","string":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\" size=\"18\"><b>Journal d’Ingmar</b>\r\n\r\nLe jour est enfin venu de quitter les Skaals. Les Anciens ont découvert la vérité sur le tertre de Skogsdrake : j’ai demandé à un voyageur de distraire le draugr Valbrandr pendant que je l’abattais. Je n’ai pas pu l’affronter seul, alors que c’était nécessaire pour devenir un véritable Skaal. À présent, je suis déshonoré et je quitte mon seul foyer pour partir à l’aventure en Bordeciel.\r\n\r\nJ’ai embarqué sur un navire appelé La Guerre d’hiver. Nous arriverons à Vendeaume dans quelques jours.\r\n[pagebreak]\r\nIl y a beaucoup de brouillard aujourd’hui. Je distingue à peine les glaciers. Pourquoi n’a-t-on pas construit de phare par ici ? Je le suggérerai peut-être au Haut Roi à mon arrivée. J’espère seulement que le capitaine sait où il va… \r\n[pagebreak]\r\n\r\nNous avons heurté la glace. Le navire s’est brisé en deux. Les survivants sombrent dans la folie. J’ai brisé Solvistapp lors d’un affrontement avec un membre d’équipage. Je pars ce soir… </font>","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000D85|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroIngmarJournal"},{"original":"Sunken Chest","string":"Coffre englouti","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000D86|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"CONT FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"BillyroIngmarChest"},{"original":"Fenrir Ingot","string":"Lingot de Fenrir","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05000873|Billyro's Weapons.esp","type":"MISC FULL","index":